{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cloys Inc., the universe's leading toaster company, and your new family! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've joined our environmental arm, where we improve the universe, one planet at a time! We are delighted to have you with us, and we are sure you will find fulfillment in this vital mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned a processed planet to be cleansed of its Klein's radiation. The connection zone has been calculated and a portal is ready to be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living Resources - Nole Fissact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an automated email, please do not reply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Thousand Cloys is an incremental game in which you have to harvest resources, import Cloys to work for you, and cleanse your assigned planet of Klein radiation as you explore and unravel its mysteries... This game is essentially active, although leaving it idle allows you to accumulate more resources. The pace is steady, and the numbers remain understandable. All the resources physically exist in this world, including the talent tree, which you'll need to discover little by little to invest your hard-earned money after each session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best toaster in the universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although still capable of toasting bread, Cloys can now send and receive messages, run errands and even mine resources in dangerous conditions. Fully automated, you simply tell them where you want them to work and let them do the rest. Then, use your resources in the Cloys Enhancement Centre to strengthen them and make them even more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the fog of Klein radiation that covers it, the planet in your care is still a mystery. Use your beacons to explore further and further and unearth the precious pulsating fields that will provide you with permanent bonuses once built and upgraded. Your superiors will also be watching with interest to see what other discoveries you make in the course of your research...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861740?t=1759155602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/0c5b4659bc9175616252bc7f4b9435c3d4465b1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759155602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/9529c9a92030d5a8e2b38c751cda6f2fd1c581a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759155602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/9529c9a92030d5a8e2b38c751cda6f2fd1c581a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759155602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cloys Inc., the universe's leading toaster company, and your new family! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've joined our environmental arm, where we improve the universe, one planet at a time! We are delighted to have you with us, and we are sure you will find fulfillment in this vital mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned a processed planet to be cleansed of its Klein's radiation. The connection zone has been calculated and a portal is ready to be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living Resources - Nole Fissact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an automated email, please do not reply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/abfa50018af4ab6df2c3e35fa2e43ac3.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Thousand Cloys is an incremental game in which you have to harvest resources, import Cloys to work for you, and cleanse your assigned planet of Klein radiation as you explore and unravel its mysteries... This game is essentially active, although leaving it idle allows you to accumulate more resources. The pace is steady, and the numbers remain understandable. All the resources physically exist in this world, including the talent tree, which you'll need to discover little by little to invest your hard-earned money after each session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best toaster in the universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/88b4757bb3199fb6b57668e905e763bf.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although still capable of toasting bread, Cloys can now send and receive messages, run errands and even mine resources in dangerous conditions. Fully automated, you simply tell them where you want them to work and let them do the rest. Then, use your resources in the Cloys Enhancement Centre to strengthen them and make them even more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.poster.avif?t=1759155602\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.webm?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/extras/51e55b32b149f566dc07a2800b203955.mp4?t=1759155602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the fog of Klein radiation that covers it, the planet in your care is still a mystery. Use your beacons to explore further and further and unearth the precious pulsating fields that will provide you with permanent bonuses once built and upgraded. Your superiors will also be watching with interest to see what other discoveries you make in the course of your research...</p>","developers":["3-50"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861740/12bb1859f09d45348136c67a9f7741606a6b82fb/header.jpg?t=1759155602","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861740/1274734436/6a1ebe1099261cbc9c47919760ab444cab02b9f3/1759147705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759148010","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861740/1274734436/6a1ebe1099261cbc9c47919760ab444cab02b9f3/1759147705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759148010","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai